the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    the Pflegegrad of *a case* is *a number*; scenario element.
    the Monatlicher Eigenanteil of *a case* is *a number*; scenario element.
    the Alleinlebend of *a case* is *a truth value*; scenario element.
    the Wohnsitz im Land of *a case* is *a truth value*; scenario element.
    Härtefallleistung holds for *a case*.
    Härtefall liegt vor holds for *a case*.
    Pflegegrad mindestens 3 holds for *a case*.
    Eigenanteil über 800 eur holds for *a case*.
    Alleinlebend holds for *a case*.
    Wohnsitz im Land holds for *a case*.
    child *a number* of Härtefall liegt vor counts for *a case*.
    Härtefall liegt vor is decided for *a case*.
    Härtefall liegt vor would hold for *a case*; unknown.
    Pflegegrad mindestens 3 is decided for *a case*.
    Eigenanteil über 800 eur is decided for *a case*.
    Alleinlebend is decided for *a case*.
    Pflegegrad mindestens 3 would hold for *a case*; unknown.
    Eigenanteil über 800 eur would hold for *a case*; unknown.

the knowledge base r4_14_haertefall includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/haertefall.ruml".

Härtefallleistung holds for a case if
    Härtefall liegt vor holds for the case
    and Wohnsitz im Land holds for the case.

child 1 of Härtefall liegt vor counts for a case if
    Pflegegrad mindestens 3 holds for the case.

child 2 of Härtefall liegt vor counts for a case if
    Eigenanteil über 800 eur holds for the case.

child 3 of Härtefall liegt vor counts for a case if
    Alleinlebend holds for the case.

% Mindestens zwei der drei Härtefallmerkmale müssen vorliegen
Härtefall liegt vor holds for a case if
    Härtefall liegt vor is decided for the case
    and a number M is the count of each N such that
        child a number N of Härtefall liegt vor counts for the case
    and M >= 2.

Härtefall liegt vor holds for a case if
    it is not the case that Härtefall liegt vor is decided for the case
    and Härtefall liegt vor would hold for the case.

Härtefall liegt vor is decided for a case if
    Pflegegrad mindestens 3 is decided for the case
    and Eigenanteil über 800 eur is decided for the case
    and Alleinlebend is decided for the case.

Wohnsitz im Land holds for a case if
    the Wohnsitz im Land of the case is true.

Pflegegrad mindestens 3 holds for a case if
    the Pflegegrad of the case is a number N
    and N >= 3.

% Where the expression has no result (a value it needs is missing), RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Pflegegrad mindestens 3 holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the Pflegegrad of the case is a number
    and Pflegegrad mindestens 3 would hold for the case.

Pflegegrad mindestens 3 is decided for a case if
    the Pflegegrad of the case is a number.

Eigenanteil über 800 eur holds for a case if
    the Monatlicher Eigenanteil of the case is a number N
    and N > 800.

% Where the expression has no result (a value it needs is missing), RUML's answer is undefined: the leaf holds only on the assumption below.
Eigenanteil über 800 eur holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the Monatlicher Eigenanteil of the case is a number
    and Eigenanteil über 800 eur would hold for the case.

Eigenanteil über 800 eur is decided for a case if
    the Monatlicher Eigenanteil of the case is a number.

Alleinlebend holds for a case if
    the Alleinlebend of the case is true.

Alleinlebend is decided for a case.

